1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Where did this idea come from?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:07,000
This is AtlasWeave,

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,000
a visual board inside Obsidian.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
I pull out two ideas
and name the connection:

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
chlorophyll breaks down,
revealing yellow pigments.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,500
Then I link this thought

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:25,000
to the passage it came from.

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,500
Save it. Close the board.

9
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Open it again.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,500
One plain click takes me back
to that exact passage,

11
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:39,000
so I can check the explanation
in context.

12
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Back on the map, I have a connection

13
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:45,000
to explain in my own words.

14
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Try AtlasWeave in Obsidian.

